{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40712","headline":"和曹监春晴见寄 · 李洞","name":"和曹监春晴见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竺庙邻钟震晓鸦，春阴盖石似仙家。\n兰台架列排书目，顾渚香浮瀹茗花。\n胶溜石松粘鹤氅，泉离冰井熨僧牙。\n功成名着扁舟去，愁覩前题罩碧纱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}